521">it.&amp;quot; And the mother got up. This has</text><text start="764.72" dur="3.679">nothing to do with a stepfather or</text><text start="766.48" dur="5.84">anything else. This has to do with the</text><text start="768.399" dur="6.161">fact that a a woman got out, the mother</text><text start="772.32" dur="4.4">of a person running for governor of one</text><text start="774.56" dur="6">of the greatest states where I set</text><text start="776.72" dur="6.08">records and said that she&amp;#39;s a liar. Her</text><text start="780.56" dur="4.88">daughter&amp;#39;s a liar. She said her daughter</text><text start="782.8" dur="5.36">lied about fake and the mother couldn&amp;#39;t</text><text start="785.44" dur="4.959">take it anymore. She basically said her</text><text start="788.16" dur="3.919">daughter should not that&amp;#39;s what she said</text><text start="790.399" dur="4.801">her daughter should not be the governor</text><text start="792.079" dur="5.601">of Ohio. To me that&amp;#39;s something that&amp;#39;s</text><text start="795.2" dur="4.639">very much fair game.</text><text start="797.68" dur="3.2">Could you preview your trip to Michigan</text><text start="799.839" dur="2.881">on Sunday?</text><text start="800.88" dur="3.519">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; My trip to Michigan is going to be very</text><text start="802.72" dur="3.6">exciting.</text><text start="804.399" dur="4.081">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; Every one of my trips is exciting. I</text><text start="806.32" dur="4.639">think we did fantastically in Iowa. I</text><text start="808.48" dur="4.24">think I think that you&amp;#39;re going to have</text><text start="810.959" dur="3.201">everybody I talked about last night&amp;#39;s</text><text start="812.72" dur="3.76">going to be elected. You&amp;#39;re going to</text><text start="814.16" dur="3.6">have a great governor, great senator. Uh</text><text start="816.48" dur="3.2">we&amp;#39;re going to have a very big one.</text><text start="817.76" dur="4.24">Right now, they&amp;#39;re saying the line is 2</text><text start="819.68" dur="5.12">miles long or four miles or 5 miles</text><text start="822" dur="5.92">long. We&amp;#39;re sold out at every single</text><text start="824.8" dur="5.279">place I go. And every single place I go,</text><text start="827.92" dur="5.2">people that are down are now winning.</text><text start="830.079" dur="5.521">Thank you very much.</text><text start="833.12" dur="4.48">How does the US military prevent these</text><text start="835.6" dur="4.16">attacks that are happening on cargo</text><text start="837.6" dur="4.88">ships and oil tankers in the straight of</text><text start="839.76" dur="5.04">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; confident? They&amp;#39;re really good. The Navy</text><text start="842.48" dur="3.68">has done a great job. We have more. You</text><text start="844.8" dur="3.599">just saw in the front page of the Wall</text><text start="846.16" dur="4.56">Street Journal. There&amp;#39;s more oil coming</text><text start="848.399" dur="5.44">out right now through the straight of</text><text start="850.72" dur="4.88">Harose than it was even before the war.</text><text start="853.839" dur="5.321">We have done a hell of a job. I hope</text><text start="855.6" dur="3.56">someday we&amp;#39;re recognized.</text><text start="859.92" dur="5.2">Mr. Do you believe Melania can make</text><text start="862.88" dur="4.88">peace in Ukraine? I think she&amp;#39;s done a</text><text start="865.12" dur="4.719">great job. I mean, she&amp;#39;s into saving</text><text start="867.76" dur="4.319">babies and bringing babies back home to</text><text start="869.839" dur="4.641">their parents and she&amp;#39;s been able to do</text><text start="872.079" dur="5.041">something that&amp;#39;s great. Been working</text><text start="874.48" dur="4.799">very hard on it. She wants to see babies</text><text start="877.12" dur="4.959">come back to their families. And that&amp;#39;s</text><text start="879.279" dur="5.041">between Russia and Ukraine. And they</text><text start="882.079" dur="5.2">worked a ceasefire</text><text start="884.32" dur="4.639">in a very rough place, rather. and baby</text><text start="887.279" dur="3.841">some radio</text><text start="888.959" dur="4.801">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; on politics. Kamla Harris was in</text><text start="891.12" dur="4.079">Mississippi last night. Mississippi is a</text><text start="893.76" dur="3.28">state that nobody really thought would</text><text start="895.199" dur="4.561">be in play. What does that have to tell</text><text start="897.04" dur="4.88">you about the Mids? Well, I won it by 32</text><text start="899.76" dur="3.68">points. They&amp;#39;ve asked me to go. I&amp;#39;m</text><text start="901.92" dur="2.32">going there, I think, on Monday.</text><text start="903.44" dur="3.519">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; Yes, sir.</text><text start="904.24" dur="4.959">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; Uh and I look forward to it. And Cindy</text><text start="906.959" dur="5.201">Hyde Smith, you know, Cindy Hyde is</text><text start="909.199" dur="5.041">fantastic. She&amp;#39;s and she&amp;#39;s very popular.</text><text start="912.16" dur="3.52">She&amp;#39;s up in the poll. She&amp;#39;s not losing.</text><text start="914.24" dur="3.2">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; You&amp;#39;ve been doing so many rallies. I&amp;#39;m</text><text start="915.68" dur="3.76">just curious, do you feel like the</text><text start="917.44" dur="3.44">strategy is working? I know he&amp;#39;s not</text><text start="919.44" dur="3.04">your favorite, but Carl Ro had an</text><text start="920.88" dur="2.8">article the other day in the turtle and</text><text start="922.48" dur="3.2">he said that there&amp;#39;s a chance of</text><text start="923.68" dur="3.839">backlash. Do you think the rally is the</text><text start="925.68" dur="4.159">best strategy so close to the midterm?</text><text start="927.519" dur="4.161">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; Look, if you have Carl Ro, he&amp;#39;s a loser.</text><text start="929.839" dur="4">He&amp;#39;s a proven he&amp;#39;s been a loser all his</text><text start="931.68" dur="4.48">life. Carl Ro doesn&amp;#39;t know what he&amp;#39;s</text><text start="933.839" dur="4.641">talking about. Look, every single place</text><text start="936.16" dur="4.32">I&amp;#39;ve gone to, every single place,</text><text start="938.48" dur="4.64">whether people were losing that were</text><text start="940.48" dur="4.88">expected to win, when I&amp;#39;m leaving, look</text><text start="943.12" dur="4.399">at Ohio, how much better he&amp;#39;s doing.</text><text start="945.36" dur="5.839">Look at everyone. Look at Iowa last</text><text start="947.519" dur="5.921">night with Ashley. She&amp;#39;s just came out</text><text start="951.199" dur="5.281">with numbers right now. Every place I&amp;#39;m</text><text start="953.44" dur="5.519">going to every place is full, loaded</text><text start="956.48" dur="4.64">with people, lines outside trying to get</text><text start="958.959" dur="3.841">in. I&amp;#39;m going to Fort Myers right now.</text><text start="961.12" dur="4.959">They say there&amp;#39;s a line of people that&amp;#39;s</text><text start="962.8" dur="6.08">5 miles long. Uh, every place I&amp;#39;ve gone</text><text start="966.079" dur="5.2">to, I&amp;#39;ve helped and every every place</text><text start="968.88" dur="4.319">wants it. The one problem is I&amp;#39;m one</text><text start="971.279" dur="4.321">person. This is a lot of work.</text><text start="973.199" dur="4.08">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; Do you think</text><text start="975.6" dur="3.28">Let me tell you, this is a lot of work.</text><text start="977.279" dur="3.68">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; Well, that&amp;#39;s what I&amp;#39;m asking. So, do you</text><text start="978.88" dur="3.759">feel like though</text><text start="980.959" dur="3.281">to squeeze? Do you feel like you say you</text><text start="982.639" dur="2.88">feel like you&amp;#39;re the only one doing it?</text><text start="984.24" dur="2.08">Do you feel like other Republicans</text><text start="985.519" dur="2.401">should be more forceful?</text><text start="986.32" dur="4.8">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; Well, I&amp;#39;m the only one that can get</text><text start="987.92" dur="4.719">25,000 people to show up. That&amp;#39;s, you</text><text start="991.12" dur="3.279">know, whether it&amp;#39;s Democrat or</text><text start="992.639" dur="4.081">Republican. That&amp;#39;s a proven fact. That&amp;#39;s</text><text start="994.399" dur="3.841">been proven for 10 years. I&amp;#39;m the only</text><text start="996.72" dur="2.72">one that can get the crowds. And I don&amp;#39;t</text><text start="998.24" dur="2.959">know why. You know, you&amp;#39;ll have to tell</text><text start="999.44" dur="4.48">me someday you&amp;#39;ll write a book about it.</text><text start="1001.199" dur="4.64">But like at Fort Meyers, they have</text><text start="1003.92" dur="3.76">thousands and thousands of people that</text><text start="1005.839" dur="5.041">were there yesterday. They were lined up</text><text start="1007.68" dur="5.76">yesterday. So that seems to be a trait</text><text start="1010.88" dur="4.879">or an ability. I I can and I want to use</text><text start="1013.44" dur="4.56">it for good purpose. And if I don&amp;#39;t</text><text start="1015.759" dur="5.2">think somebody&amp;#39;s really worthy or good</text><text start="1018" dur="6.24">job, I don&amp;#39;t go. But, uh, Mississippi,</text><text start="1020.959" dur="5.36">I&amp;#39;m going today. I&amp;#39;m going for a man</text><text start="1024.24" dur="4.079">who&amp;#39;s going to be a great governor. I</text><text start="1026.319" dur="3.841">think he&amp;#39;s going to be a great governor.</text><text start="1028.319" dur="3.36">So, Byron, we&amp;#39;re going to see him in a</text><text start="1030.16" dur="2.96">little while. We have, but we have a</text><text start="1031.679" dur="3.681">tremendous crowd of people. I don&amp;#39;t know</text><text start="1033.12" dur="3.439">if you&amp;#39;re going and you&amp;#39;re doing and</text><text start="1035.36" dur="4.199">you&amp;#39;re doing a very good job, by the</text><text start="1036.559" dur="3">way.</text><text start="1040.72" dur="4.16">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; I&amp;#39;m going to be going to Michigan. I</text><text start="1042.88" dur="3.28">don&amp;#39;t know. Is it Saturday, Sunday?</text><text start="1044.88" dur="1.919">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; Sunday. But, sir, you&amp;#39;re on. You&amp;#39;re on</text><text start="1046.16" dur="2.399">to pork.</text><text start="1046.799" dur="4.641">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; I look forward to Michigan. I can talk</text><text start="1048.559" dur="6.081">about a man who&amp;#39;s a Muslim Brotherhood</text><text start="1051.44" dur="4.72">person who&amp;#39;s a jihadist and who can&amp;#39;t be</text><text start="1054.64" dur="4.64">in our Senate.</text><text start="1056.16" dur="4.72">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; Is there any chance?</text><text start="1059.28" dur="3.12">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; He&amp;#39;s a fake guy. All you have to do is</text><text start="1060.88" dur="4.56">look at his statements from two years</text><text start="1062.4" dur="5.2">ago. I&amp;#39;m I&amp;#39;m looking forward to going to</text><text start="1065.44" dur="5.119">And by the way, Mike Rogers will be a</text><text start="1067.6" dur="7.84">great senator. I&amp;#39;m looking at a man who</text><text start="1070.559" dur="8.081">is I call him Muhammad but uh Abdul</text><text start="1075.44" dur="4.64">is Abdul. It&amp;#39;s actually his middle name</text><text start="1078.64" dur="3.279">is actually Muhammad. I don&amp;#39;t know if</text><text start="1080.08" dur="4.88">you know that or not. His name is Abdul</text><text start="1081.919" dur="5.601">Muhammad. Uh he&amp;#39;s a fake. He&amp;#39;s a total</text><text start="1084.96" dur="5.44">fake. And we can&amp;#39;t have fakes. And you</text><text start="1087.52" dur="5.519">can&amp;#39;t can you imagine this guy? He was a</text><text start="1090.4" dur="6.88">member probably still is of the Muslim</text><text start="1093.039" dur="6.481">Brotherhood. We can&amp;#39;t have him.</text><text start="1097.28" dur="4.639">We can&amp;#39;t have him in the United States.</text><text start="1099.52" dur="4.399">We can&amp;#39;t have him in the United States.</text><text start="1101.919" dur="4.321">And I look forward to I tell you what, I</text><text start="1103.919" dur="4.961">look so forward to Michigan. And I think</text><text start="1106.24" dur="5.04">it&amp;#39;s going to be wild. But I look so</text><text start="1108.88" dur="5.36">because he&amp;#39;s a total phony. He&amp;#39;s a</text><text start="1111.28" dur="5.92">little phony and everything about him is</text><text start="1114.24" dur="4.64">fake and he&amp;#39;s a liar and he talks about</text><text start="1117.2" dur="3.92">all these things about like he&amp;#39;s a</text><text start="1118.88" dur="4.48">moderate. He&amp;#39;s not a rat. He&amp;#39;s a</text><text start="1121.12" dur="4.72">jihadist. He&amp;#39;s a vicious violent</text><text start="1123.36" dur="5.48">jihadist and he has no place in our</text><text start="1125.84" dur="3">government</text><text start="1130.48" dur="3.92">to donate their fee from the overseas</text><text start="1132.48" dur="3.439">trip to your presidential library.</text><text start="1134.4" dur="3.2">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; I understand they&amp;#39;ve done I didn&amp;#39;t know</text><text start="1135.919" dur="3.201">about that but I somebody told me they</text><text start="1137.6" dur="3.6">did that. Very nice.</text><text start="1139.12" dur="3.84">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; Are you still looking into whether their</text><text start="1141.2" dur="2.24">travel was appropriate or any</text><text start="1142.96" dur="2.56">complication?</text><text start="1143.44" dur="3.76">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; No, I&amp;#39;m not. No, no, they took the money</text><text start="1145.52" dur="4.08">and they gave it to essentially a</text><text start="1147.2" dur="3.92">charity. No, that was I just heard that.</text><text start="1149.6" dur="4.72">I think it&amp;#39;s a very nice thing to do,</text><text start="1151.12" dur="5.04">Mr. President, my son, this is my son,</text><text start="1154.32" dur="3.599">Mr. President.</text><text start="1156.16" dur="3.84">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; Oh, you&amp;#39;re much better looking than your</text><text start="1157.919" dur="2.801">father. Look at all that hair he&amp;#39;s got,</text><text start="1160" dur="2.08">huh?</text><text start="1160.72" dur="2.8">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; That&amp;#39;s good. He&amp;#39;s a good looking. You</text><text start="1162.08" dur="2.719">got a good father.</text><text start="1163.52" dur="3.92">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; Now he&amp;#39;s going to ask me a nice</text><text start="1164.799" dur="4.24">question. Tell dad, ask me a nice</text><text start="1167.44" dur="3.28">question. I I want to ask you about Elon</text><text start="1169.039" dur="3.52">Musk. So, if the Democrats win control</text><text start="1170.72" dur="3.68">of Congress, how concerned are you that</text><text start="1172.559" dur="3.841">they&amp;#39;ll go after Elon Musk?</text><text start="1174.4" dur="5.04">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; Well,</text><text start="1176.4" dur="5.2">Elon&amp;#39;s a brilliant guy, and I I have an</text><text start="1179.44" dur="4.4">expression. We have to protect our</text><text start="1181.6" dur="4.079">brilliant people because we don&amp;#39;t have</text><text start="1183.84" dur="4">too many of them. There aren&amp;#39;t too many</text><text start="1185.679" dur="4.401">of them in the world. And Elon&amp;#39;s done</text><text start="1187.84" dur="4.64">nothing wrong. Elon is very good guy.</text><text start="1190.08" dur="4.959">He&amp;#39;s a very different kind of a guy. But</text><text start="1192.48" dur="4.4">I think people have an obligation to</text><text start="1195.039" dur="3.601">protect our geniuses. You know, there</text><text start="1196.88" dur="3.28">aren&amp;#39;t that many of them. We&amp;#39;re leading</text><text start="1198.64" dur="4.32">in everything right now. We&amp;#39;re leading</text><text start="1200.16" dur="4.72">in SI. We&amp;#39;re leading in everything. It&amp;#39;s</text><text start="1202.96" dur="3.68">amazing how we&amp;#39;re doing. But we are</text><text start="1204.88" dur="3.6">leading super intelligence. We&amp;#39;re</text><text start="1206.64" dur="3.919">leading in</text><text start="1208.48" dur="3.84">every single category. We have more</text><text start="1210.559" dur="4.48">things being built in our country right</text><text start="1212.32" dur="3.12">now than any country has ever had in</text><text start="1215.039" dur="1.841">history.</text><text start="1215.44" dur="3.44">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; Is it right for the richest man in the</text><text start="1216.88" dur="4.32">world to have so much power over what</text><text start="1218.88" dur="4.159">goes on before you think?</text><text start="1221.2" dur="4.32">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; Well, I don&amp;#39;t think he does. I think</text><text start="1223.039" dur="4.401">he&amp;#39;s first of all, he&amp;#39;s a very good</text><text start="1225.52" dur="4.48">person. He&amp;#39;s not going to do anything</text><text start="1227.44" dur="6">wrong. Uh he&amp;#39;s a very brilliant person</text><text start="1230" dur="5.28">or Starling and other things, right? But</text><text start="1233.44" dur="4.64">Elon will never do anything wrong. I</text><text start="1235.28" dur="4.879">know him very well. He&amp;#39;s a fair person</text><text start="1238.08" dur="4.56">and you know it&amp;#39;s an unusual situation</text><text start="1240.159" dur="4.64">where they&amp;#39;re talking to private a</text><text start="1242.64" dur="3.039">private company but he&amp;#39;s not going to do</text><text start="1244.799" dur="2.161">anything that&amp;#39;s wrong.</text><text start="1245.679" dur="3.36">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; I ask you about Canada tariffs. You&amp;#39;re</text><text start="1246.96" dur="4.24">going to Michigan tomorrow. Mike Rogers</text><text start="1249.039" dur="4.161">has said that Canada tariff war has to</text><text start="1251.2" dur="4.32">end. I mean it&amp;#39;ll affect his business.</text><text start="1253.2" dur="5.12">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; Well well Canada wants very much to make</text><text start="1255.52" dur="4.88">a deal because of tariffs. They want to</text><text start="1258.32" dur="4.4">make a deal and as you know they&amp;#39;ve been</text><text start="1260.4" dur="4.32">making 90 billion a year from for many</text><text start="1262.72" dur="4.72">years with us. They&amp;#39;re making anywhere</text><text start="1264.72" dur="5.199">from 80 to hundred billion dollars. And</text><text start="1267.44" dur="4.719">I said, &amp;quot;Nope, I&amp;#39;m not doing that.&amp;quot; And</text><text start="1269.919" dur="6.441">Canada now is very much prepared to make</text><text start="1272.159" dur="4.201">a deal. Mr. President,</text><text start="1278.72" dur="3.28">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; how did your meeting Catholic people the</text><text start="1280.64" dur="2.159">other day, sir?</text><text start="1282" dur="1.6">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; Really good.</text><text start="1282.799" dur="2.961">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; What are you talking about?</text><text start="1283.6" dur="4.959">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; I finally had a nice group of people in</text><text start="1285.76" dur="5.919">my office. The Cath the Catholic uh</text><text start="1288.559" dur="4.801">representatives, bishops, and others. Uh</text><text start="1291.679" dur="4.961">it was a great meeting. Well, they</text><text start="1293.36" dur="4.559">prayed. They mostly prayed. It was</text><text start="1296.64" dur="3.84">actually a very nice group. They&amp;#39;re</text><text start="1297.919" dur="4.801">great. They were great people.</text><text start="1300.48" dur="5.439">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; NFL playing in France this weekend.</text><text start="1302.72" dur="5.92">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; Well, you worry about it. But I I think</text><text start="1305.919" dur="4.64">maybe it&amp;#39;s looking like tomorrow is</text><text start="1308.64" dur="4.24">going to be a bad day in France. So, you</text><text start="1310.559" dur="4.801">worry about it.</text><text start="1312.88" dur="4.32">I would have said the NFL could have</text><text start="1315.36" dur="4.16">probably postpone that match if you want</text><text start="1317.2" dur="4.56">to know because France is really in</text><text start="1319.52" dur="5.039">trouble. That&amp;#39;s what happens when you go</text><text start="1321.76" dur="5.52">left. That&amp;#39;s what happens when you allow</text><text start="1324.559" dur="5.12">unlimited numbers of people into your</text><text start="1327.28" dur="6.04">country from very unfriendly countries.</text><text start="1329.679" dur="3.641">That&amp;#39;s what you&amp;#39;re going to have.</text></transcript>